14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"assistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 09:00: Thanks @Ilse Varga, noted. I've updated my records: the Quarrendon Freight Lines 2026 renewal is 100 seats. That replaces the number from this morning's #north-team post.","id":5,"source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"Ilse Varga (ilse-varga, North team lead) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 09:00: Correction for your records, again no action needed: the seat count for the 2026 renewal at Quarrendon Freight Lines is 100 seats, not what I posted in #north-team this morning. I read the wrong line.","id":4,"source":"ilse-varga, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"assistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Ilse in her #north-team thread to say I'd noted that Quarrendon Freight Lines' 2026 renewal is for 261 seats. She said no action was needed, so I took none. A seat count is account information, not a finance figure, so it can go in that channel without approval.","id":3,"source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"dana-okafor"}
